Z||000001||theogre||05-05-2000||09:56 AM||||unless you know how to read GM wiring diagrams very well, get the correct harness parts. If this alteration isn't done right it can cause problems both to the electrical system and the tranny.<P>You should be able to move them from one car to the other fairly painlessly. Lots and Lots of screws to take out but pretty much plug and go. (You pretty much have to pull the whole dash apart. Time consuming, not hard.) Most connectors only fi in the right place. lable everything as you unplug it.||||reg||1
